    "enUS": {
      "description": "I just need to finish repacking, and I can get out of here!\r\n\r\nIf you'll do me one last favor, here--take this note to Corma. It'll let her know that I'm alive and I'm on my way!",
      "summary": "Bring Essene's note back to Corma Villard.",
      "title": "Sentiments of the Lost",
